<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Facture {{ order.trackingNumber|default('TL-' ~ order.id) }} — TechLink</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 25px 30px;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #0F172A;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .header-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #F97316;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0F172A;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .logo-tag {
            color: #64748B;
        }
        .logo-brand {
            color: #F97316;
        }
        .company-info {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #64748B;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .invoice-title-block {
            text-align: right;
        }
        .invoice-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #0F172A;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .invoice-ref {
            font-family: Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #F97316;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .invoice-date {
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #64748B;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .two-cols {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .info-card {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .card-header {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #64748B;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .info-line {
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .info-line strong {
            color: #1E293B;
        }
        .items-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .items-table th {
            background-color: #0F172A;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 7px 8px;
            font-size: 9px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .items-table td {
            padding: 8px 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .items-table tr:nth-child(even) td {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 2px 5px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            background-color: #E2E8F0;
            color: #334155;
            font-family: Courier, monospace;
        }
        .badge-color {
            background-color: #FFEDD5;
            color: #C2410C;
        }
        .badge-sn {
            background-color: #E0F2FE;
            color: #0369A1;
        }
        .totals-table {
            width: 45%;
            margin-left: auto;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .totals-table td {
            padding: 5px 8px;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .totals-table tr.grand-total td {
            border-top: 2px solid #0F172A;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #C2410C;
            background-color: #FFF7ED;
            padding: 8px;
        }
        .warranty-box {
            background-color: #F0FDF4;
            border: 1px solid #BBF7D0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #166534;
        }
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            padding-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 8px;
            color: #94A3B8;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Entreprise & Facture -->
    <table class="header-table">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 55%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div class="logo">
                    <span class="logo-tag">&lt;/</span><span class="logo-brand">tech</span>link<span class="logo-tag">&gt;</span>
                </div>
                <div class="company-info">
                    <strong>TechLink Sénégal SARL</strong> • Matériel High-Tech & Stations de travail<br>
                    Point E, Boulevard de l'Est, Immeuble Horizon, Dakar, Sénégal<br>
                    NINEA : 009845123 • RCCM : SN-DKR-2024-B-11200<br>
                    Tél : +221 77 395 69 66 • Email : support@techlink.sn
                </div>
            </td>
            <td class="invoice-title-block" style="width: 45%; vertical-align: top;">
                <div class="invoice-title">Facture Officielle</div>
                <div class="invoice-ref">N° {{ order.trackingNumber|default('TL-' ~ order.id) }}</div>
                <div class="invoice-date">
                    Date : {{ order.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}<br>
                    Statut : <strong>{{ order.status|upper }}</strong>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Cartes Client & Livraison (Compatible Client Connecté & Invité) -->
    <table class="two-cols">
        <tr>
            <td class="info-card" style="width: 48%; margin-right: 4%;">
                <div class="card-header">Client Destinataire</div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Nom :</strong> 
                    {% if order.user %}
                        {{ order.user.firstName }} {{ order.user.lastName }}
                    {% else %}
                        {{ order.guestFirstName|default('Client') }} {{ order.guestLastName|default('Invité') }}
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Email :</strong> 
                    {{ order.user ? order.user.email : (order.guestEmail|default('Non renseigné')) }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Téléphone :</strong> {{ order.deliveryPhone|default('Non renseigné') }}
                </div>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 4%;"></td>
            <td class="info-card" style="width: 48%;">
                <div class="card-header">Expédition & Mode de Paiement</div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Mode :</strong> 
                    {{ order.deliveryMethod == 'PICKUP' ? 'Retrait en boutique (Point E)' : 'Coursier Express Tiak-Tiak Dakar' }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Adresse :</strong> {{ order.deliveryAddress }}
                </div>
                <div class="info-line">
                    <strong>Paiement :</strong> {{ order.paymentMethod|default('WAVE') }} 
                    <span class="badge">({{ order.escrowStatus != 'NONE' ? order.escrowStatus : (order.status == 'pending' ? 'En attente' : 'Validé') }})</span>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Tableau des Produits Commandés -->
    <table class="items-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 45%;">Désignation Matériel</th>
                <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">SKU</th>
                <th style="width: 10%; text-align: center;">Qté</th>
                <th style="width: 15%; text-align: right;">Prix Unitaire</th>
                <th style="width: 15%; text-align: right;">Total XOF</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% for item in order.orderItems %}
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <strong>{{ item.product.name }}</strong>
                        {% if item.selectedColor %}
                            <br><span class="badge badge-color">Couleur : {{ item.selectedColor }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if item.serialNumber %}
                            <br><span class="badge badge-sn">S/N IMEI : {{ item.serialNumber }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: center; font-family: Courier, monospace; font-size: 9px; color: #64748B;">
                        {{ item.product.sku|default('SKU-TL-' ~ item.product.id) }}
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">
                        {{ item.quantity }}
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: right; font-family: Courier, monospace;">
                        {{ item.unitPrice|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: right; font-weight: bold; font-family: Courier, monospace;">
                        {{ (item.unitPrice * item.quantity)|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- Tableau des Totaux -->
    <table class="totals-table">
        <tr>
            <td style="color: #64748B;">Sous-total matériel :</td>
            <td style="text-align: right; font-family: Courier, monospace; font-weight: bold;">
                {{ (order.total - order.deliveryFee)|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} XOF
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="color: #64748B;">Frais de livraison Dakar :</td>
            <td style="text-align: right; font-family: Courier, monospace;">
                {% if order.deliveryFee > 0 %}
                    {{ order.deliveryFee|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} XOF
                {% else %}
                    <span style="color: #16A34A; font-weight: bold;">Gratuit</span>
                {% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
        {% if order.couponCode %}
            <tr>
                <td style="color: #16A34A;">Coupon appliqué ({{ order.couponCode }}) :</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; font-family: Courier, monospace; color: #16A34A;">Inclus</td>
            </tr>
        {% endif %}
        <tr class="grand-total">
            <td>TOTAL PAYÉ :</td>
            <td style="text-align: right;">{{ order.total|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} XOF</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <!-- Encadré Garantie Certifiée Sénégal -->
    <div class="warranty-box">
        <strong>CERTIFICAT DE GARANTIE MATÉRIELLE ATELIER TECHLINK :</strong><br>
        Ce document fait office de bon de garantie officiel pour une durée de <strong>24 mois</strong> à compter de la date d'émission. 
        Toute panne matérielle couverte par la garantie donne droit à un diagnostic gratuit sous 24h et à une réparation/échange en atelier au Point E, Dakar.
    </div>

    <!-- Pied de Page Légal -->
    <div class="footer">
        TechLink Sénégal SARL au capital de 10 000 000 FCFA • RCCM SN-DKR-2024-B-11200 • NINEA 009845123 • TVA non applicable selon le régime en vigueur.<br>
        Merci de votre confiance. Pour toute assistance technique ou suivi : support@techlink.sn ou WhatsApp au +221 77 395 69 66.
    </div>

</body>
</html>